      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Outbound dependencies\nWhat this service calls, keyed by `server_address` \u2014 the host actually contacted. The only per-dependency timing the platform has: the service graph pairs spans *within* a trace, so it shows services that are instrumented, never a third party that is not.\n\nRequires `otelhttp.NewTransport` on the client. An SDK that builds its own transport (`gocloak`, `resty`) reports nothing here and severs the trace too."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
